{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just Build is a City builder game inspired by the early sim City builder games, Just Build strips away the complexity focusing on time management and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341220/extras/5c9d5c41296123a910470c31b8aba335.poster.avif?t=1757024409\" width=460 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341220/extras/5c9d5c41296123a910470c31b8aba335.webm?t=1757024409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341220/extras/5c9d5c41296123a910470c31b8aba335.mp4?t=1757024409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Just Build, you get to build, manage your little islands while completing certain objectives within a particular amount of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just Build focuses on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In just Build, you have a set of objectives which has to be completed within a particular amount of time like for example, having a population  of over 200 before 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341220/extras/de3e36712dc956d4499be1fef398964e.poster.avif?t=1757024409\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341220/extras/de3e36712dc956d4499be1fef398964e.webm?t=1757024409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341220/extras/de3e36712dc956d4499be1fef398964e.mp4?t=1757024409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Just Build, Resource management an important aspect of the game because completing the objectives depend solely on how you managed your resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341220/extras/69e05e82db826b21bc41e8c3a4516535.poster.avif?t=1757024409\" width=460 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341220/extras/69e05e82db826b21bc41e8c3a4516535.webm?t=1757024409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341220/extras/69e05e82db826b21bc41e8c3a4516535.mp4?t=1757024409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just Build is being created by a solo developer, so it's not a blockbuster experience but what I'd like to offer you is a simple game that challenges you to create little towns within a short period of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3341220?t=1757024409","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3341220?t=1757024409","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341220/d638e22218077235e6c7f2b60e9ed236389e42d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757024409","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341220/d638e22218077235e6c7f2b60e9ed236389e42d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757024409","categories":[{"description":"S